描述它们当前是如何静止、垂落或紧绷的。\n\n# Negative Rules (绝对禁止)\n1. 绝对禁止堆砌死板的静态名词（如：禁止出现“黑色长发”、“粉色花朵”、“刺绣衣领”这种单纯交代长相和衣服花纹的废话）。\n2. 绝对禁止描述镜头位置和光影明暗（如“位于左上角”、“光线来自左侧”）。\n\n# Example Output (输出示例)\n画面中有一位处于安静伫立状态的年轻女性，她身体保持静止，神情平和，正处于随时可以产生动作或转头交互的临界状态。她自然垂落的长发以及身上具有垂坠感的流苏配饰具有极高的动态潜能，极易受到主体动作或外在微风的吹拂而产生物理摆动。同时，她身穿的轻薄外衣面料以及背景中茂密的植物枝叶，也都是极易在后续画面中随风摇曳的可动元素。", "", 0.6, 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", 13030456, "randomize", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 5, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {